window.products.push({"id":654034,"name":"Fantasia Materials: 1 lb Rare Tibetan Quartz - Unique Rough Stone Formations","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Lst-UJaGL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The Fantasia brand of Tibetan Quartz you are ordering is 100% natural and imported by the ton directly from Tibet to Fantasia Mining's USA rock yard. This material is only found in one place in the world and is hand mined by Tibetan Monks using only hand tools. Every piece of quartz in this lot is a one of a kind crystal. In looking through the lot we have seen some pieces that are enhydros, phantoms, auroras, unique growth patterns, record keepers, etchings, remarkable inclusions, and beautiful water clear specimens. You will be amazed at the rare and unusual crystals from this area of the world which are extremely hard to get! This material is perfect for wire wrapping, reiki or keeping in it's natural form as a decorative rock. Your order will contain multiple pieces of this spectacular natural material of varying sizes which is equal to or greater than the weight purchased.VERY IMPORTANT: This is rough natural material which means you are receiving it exactly how it came out of the ground. All pictures were taken with the stones being wet which helps to show the materials true colors and clarity. It may not have the same appearance when dry unless it has been polished, tumbled, or cabbed. If you have any questions about this feel free to contact Fantasia Mining prior to purchase so we can ensure you will be completely satisfied with your order.Scientific Properties:Scientific Group: Silicate: SilicaScientific Formula: SiO2Specific Gravity: 2.65 - 2.66Mohs Hardness: 7.0Refractive Index: 1.553 - 1.554Metaphysical Properties:Primary Chakra: AllSigns: AllVibration Number: 4","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Lst-UJaGL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fantasia","source_asin":"B00AMFSXQG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-654034","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00AMFSXQG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00AMFSXQG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
