window.products.push({"id":654111,"name":"Eastern Rock Natural Dried Pampas Grass 5stems 40\" Fluffy, Soft，Tall，Large and Elegant for Flower Arrangements Wedding Home Decor (Cream white-5PC-100","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.6,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ik9D+UpqL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"1. When you receive it, it is in the closed state. It is recommended to open it outdoors for the first time.Because the natural plant trunk will have small miscellaneous branches and wool drop. 2.Please put it directly under the sun and bask in it for 0.5-1.5 hours according to the intensity of the sun. It will become a natural, fluffy and beautiful decoration.At this time you only need to gently shake off the adhesion of the wool it can be used.Please do not shake forcefully to avoid simply broken branches. 3. This is the dry body of a natural plant (Pampas). Each pampas grass is unique, its color, size, posture are different.It will shed some wool and may carry a little grass seed, these are its natural properties. It is a very good natural decoration, can enhance the level of decoration (quality), increase the atmosphere of the party. 4. Do not try to shake out the wool.Please try not to touch it during decoration to reduce the drop of wool.You can also spray it with styling fluid to prevent the wool from falling off when it is fluffy. 5.Just like a flower needs watering, it also needs maintenance.But it is very simple, cloudy days, wet days, even when you see it drooping, you just need to give it the sun, it can always fluffy beautiful. 6.Perfect height: Pampas grass is about 100cm in total length and 60-70cm for the feathered flower (feathered part). 7.Soft and fluffy ： Add a soft touch of nature to your living space with these fluffy pampas grass stalks. Showcase these 40\" long stems in a decorative floor vase, a tabletop glass jar, or ceramic pot. SATISFACTION GUARANTEE - If you encounter any problems or are not satisfied in any way, just send us an email and we will provide the best solution and all issues will be resolved within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ik9D+UpqL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Eastern Rock","source_asin":"B098MJMF83","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-654111","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B098MJMF83","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B098MJMF83","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
