window.products.push({"id":654340,"name":"SOCHOW Cooling Blanket for Bed, Lightweight Breathable Soft Double Side Summer Blanket for Adults Baby Kids, Grey 60 × 80 Inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Xeg3+6jeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cooling and Cozy: Cooling blanket can keep you cool and dry by quickly absorbing and dispersing unnecessary body heat, help night sweats and hot sleepers resist the summer heat and humidity, fall asleep faster, and enjoy all-night comfort. The leaf pattern design of the blanket also adds a touch of visual coolness. Double-sided Design: Cooling blanket adopts a double-sided design with cool PE and bamboo fiber on the front, which makes you feel cool, soft and comfortable, suitable for hot summer use. The back side is made of 100% pure cotton, which is breathable, elastic, soft and warm, perfect for spring and autumn use. Versatile Usage: The size of cooling blanket is 60 × 80 inches. It can be used on bed, sofa, couch or for pets. It is so light that you can also take it to outdoor travel or camping. The multifunctional blanket can keep you sleeping in a cool and comfortable environment,which is your best choice. Easy to Care: The blanket can be machine washed in cold water below 30°C and dried at low temperature. It is recommended to pack it in a laundry bag to avoid entanglement or damage. Do not expose the blanket to the sun. Excellent Customer Service: Please be aware that no cooling fabric will stay cool indefinitely. We recommend using our cooling blanket with an air conditioner or fan for better cooling. If you have any questions or dissatisfaction, please feel free to contact us, we will provide best service for you, and please rest assured to buy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Xeg3+6jeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SOCHOW","source_asin":"B09VSXJBY6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-654340","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09VSXJBY6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09VSXJBY6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
