window.products.push({"id":654497,"name":"GiniHomer Can Opener, Manual Can Opener Smooth Edge, 3 in 1 Stainless Steel Can Opener with Ergonomic Designed Comfort Grips and Safe Cutting","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51hlkrd8mGL._AC_SL1260_.jpg","description":"Why did you choose our Manual Can Opener Our can opener can support every type of can, the creative design can help you open the cans easily. This can opener fits for allsize cans. It is an essential gadget for the kitchen. Note: Please don't open the entire cover on the can in case the cover drops on the food, and easy to clean. Flush and dry immediately, after using the manual can opener. So that it can works more durable. Bottle Opener Specifications: Dimension (Φ*H): 8.6 X 1.9 X 1.5 inch Weight: 0.44 lb About GiniHomer Brand GiniHomer is a purely American brand that aims to spread the idea that everyone has a better lifestyle with nice, satisfying products. We focus on details, and experience as well.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51hlkrd8mGL._AC_SL1260_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GiniHomer","source_asin":"B09F3NN1B7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-654497","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09F3NN1B7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09F3NN1B7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
