window.products.push({"id":654539,"name":"Reusable Gallon bags 6 PACK Extra Large Reusable Freezer Bags BPA Free Leakproof Plastic Bags Reusable Food Storage Bags Silicone Kids Snack Bags Reus","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LXKkCgBGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【CUTE PRINTS & FOOD GRADE MATERIALS】：Different from the conventional reusable food storage bags on the market, the unique fruit print and the underwater world print design makes the gallon freezer bag more beautiful, childlike design more loved by children. The printed sandwich bag is made of high quality food contact grade PEVA material, BPA-Free, chloride-free and phthalate-free, reusable design makes the food bags not only environmentally friendly, but also a health and safety guarantee. 【LEAKPROOF&DOUBLE SEAL】Reusable sandwich bag with new upgraded double-layer zipper chain, more smooth, easier to switch, convenient for children to use.The reusable large ziplock bag also has a good seal to ensure that the zipper is easy to open and close at the same time to ensure the airtightness.The thickened design of the food bag body makes it more durable, waterproof and leak-proof than similar bags. The good airtightness makes it very suitable for storing food in the refrigerator. 【EXTRA LARGE&EASY TO CLEAN】Our reusable 1 gallon ziplock storage bags measure 11'x11'inch . The set contains 6 PACK Extra large gallon bags, 3 fruit prints and 3 underwater world prints. Extra large capacity is very suitable for steak, sandwiches, cosmetics, clothes, travel supplies and so on, is the perfect companion for family, travel, cabinet storage. The reusable freezer bags is easy to clean, we recommend you hand wash with soap in cold or warm water and then invert it on a cup to dry. 【FREEZER SAFE&TRANSPORT DESIGN】The reusable silicone bags for food storage is ideal for storing and freezing meat, fruits, vegetables, etc. It can keep food fresher, so you can enjoy fresh and delicious food at any time, and it can also keep the refrigerator tidy and save space. The reusable snack bags for kids with a printed side and transparent design, so you do not need to open the gallon size ziplock bags can easily distinguish the food in the bag, saving time. 【100% CUSTOMER SATISFACTION GUARANTEED & MULTI-PURPOSE】 If you are not 100% satisfied with the reusable food storage bags, please feel free to contact us, we offer 100% money back guarantee and will solve your problem promptly so that you can shop with confidence. The food-grade reusable storage bags are versatile and can be used for food storage, outdoor picnics, travel storage, family portioning, etc. They are a small helper in your life and meet your various storage needs in your daily life.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LXKkCgBGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KITHELP","source_asin":"B0BVZ5MTGM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-654539","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BVZ5MTGM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BVZ5MTGM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
