window.products.push({"id":654675,"name":"iFAVO Reusable Grocery Shopping Tote Bags Foldable into Attached Pouch Durable Light Weight Flat Bottom","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71F8ZH7-hEL._AC_UL1001_.jpg","description":"Best Choice of Gift One pack of the shopping bag constitutes 6 roomy tote bags with various patterns, which are perfect for grocery shopping, farmer market, seaside holiday or travel souvenir shopping. Makes it be an adorable gift with the colorful patterns to delight people, as well as quite a practical gift to share with your family, friends for holidays and birthdays. Reusable for Eco-friendly Life-style The bag can be easily cleaned by washer for reusing, meaning that no longer have all the toxic plastic bags at home. Above all, how many plastic bags you will help to eliminate for our mother earth! The more of us use the reusable totes, the greater impact we will make on the earth. This bag just aims to create a future with a green, happy and healthy planet and we need you to join us! Sturdy with Large 50 lbs Capacity Made of durable nylon material with fine stitching, this shopping bag is sturdy enough to withstand weight up to 50lbs. Moreover, the widened long handles of these tote bags are continuous with the body so the handle not only allows you to place it over shoulder, but also helps improving the weight limit. Large Volume to Hold More Measuring 14.96” (L) x 4.72” (W) x 13.77” (H), these totes are bigger and much sturdier than plastic grocery bags. Able to hold a ton with 1 trip which is equivalent to 2 trips back and forth from the car to the store with plastic bag for grocery shopping. And no worry about it getting dirty for the nylon material that can be washed and dry quick. Foldable & Flat Bottom Do you always think “OH, well, I forgot my shopping bags again” every time you are on the way to market? But no such problem with these shopping bags! It can be easily folded up into the attached pouch and small enough to fit in pocket. Then you won’t forget them during next trip!.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71F8ZH7-hEL._AC_UL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ifavo","source_asin":"B0834R5Q9V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-654675","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0834R5Q9V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0834R5Q9V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":654676,"name":"Dandelion - Ivory Basic Pattern - Set of 2 Naturally-Dyed Cotton Turkish Hand Towels Peshkir - 38x19 Inches - Dark Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A14pEQBAhqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Peshkir is the smaller version of peshtemal and it is utilized as hand towel, face towel, kitchen towel, tea towel, dish cloth, dish towel, fitness/gym towel etc. Peshtemal is a traditional Turkish bath towel. They have been used for centuries in Turkish hammam. (Hammam is an Anatolian steam bath.) As Dandelion Textile, we aim to make sure that our customers experience this Turkish authentic lifestyle with a great quality/price ratio. Our peshtemals are 100% high-quality cotton and natural-dyed. They are absolutely chemical-free. They are durable to frequent washing. And it is a fact that each time a cotton peshtemal is washed, it gets softer. Turkish peshtemals are known to be highly absorbent, lightweight and fast-drying. These features make them ideal for bathrooms, traveling, the gym and the beach. Due to its compact form, Turkish peshtemals are fast-dry towels. The fastness will amaze you. Thin and lightweight, it's the perfect easy-to-carry towel. When you are going for swimming, the last thing you need is a heavy beach towel. Peshtemals are preferred for beach/pool use since they are lightweight and fast-drying. It takes very little space in your luggage or bath linen closet. It's a must-have for anyone who travels. Peshtemal is also a practical alternative to the thick bath towels in your bathroom. Peshtemal is also a perfect gift for your loved ones. An appreciated present for a bachelor party, a baby shower, Mother's Day, New Year, Valentine's Day, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A14pEQBAhqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dandelion Textile","source_asin":"B078NYHWBW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-654676","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078NYHWBW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B078NYHWBW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
