window.products.push({"id":654723,"name":"Danforth Pewter Captain Oil Lamp – Traditional And Vintage Style Oil Lamps For Indoor Use – 9” High With Glass Chimney, Made In USA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":225.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cplJ3s0GL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Danforth Captain Oil Lamp – Old world metal work meets modern design. The base of each lamp is handspun on a 100 year old lathe in Vermont and is shaped from 100% lead free pewter creating a satin finish. Each is 9” tall with hand-blown glass chimney. History – Oil lamps were often used in colonial America to light homes and bring families together and noted in expressions like burning the midnight oil. This rich tradition continues today with these vintage style oil lamps. Uses – These lamps can be used inside as a centerpiece to a dining room table or on a living room end table. Or taken outside on the patio to better enjoy your evenings. Also, a unique conversation starter for friends and dinner guests. Give As a Gift – Each product comes in a gift box. A wonderful addition to many homes that can be used in a variety of settings indoors and outdoors. It also makes for fine wedding gift for newlyweds and a nice Christmas or holiday gift to parents. Danforth – All of our oil lamps are handmade in Middlebury, Vermont by our team of local artisans, who cast, spin, polish, paint, and assemble raw metal to form the exquisite object you hold in your hands.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cplJ3s0GL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DANFORTH","source_asin":"B0040HH4PS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-654723","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0040HH4PS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0040HH4PS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
